Most people can't even hold out for two minutes.

1049
00:39:43,196 --> 00:39:45,266
- I would've turned back. - Na Ra held out.

1050
00:39:45,426 --> 00:39:48,535
- Fun Run Crew is in Zone Two. - That's right.

1051
00:39:48,536 --> 00:39:51,035
- When you're in Zone 5, - Zone 5.

1052
00:39:51,036 --> 00:39:52,965
you continue to hit your limits.

1053
00:39:52,966 --> 00:39:54,735
- It's a high-intensity workout. - Totally.

1054
00:39:54,736 --> 00:39:56,905
- If you look at the records... - He held out.

1055
00:39:56,906 --> 00:39:58,445
- He held out. - He held out.

1056
00:39:58,446 --> 00:39:59,576
(Embarrassed)

1057
