1065
00:40:19,066 --> 00:40:20,196
It really recharges you.

1066
00:40:20,326 --> 00:40:21,865
I bet it tastes amazing.

1067
00:40:21,866 --> 00:40:23,535
- Seriously. - It's insane.

1068
00:40:23,536 --> 00:40:24,866
- I bet it tastes amazing. - I bet it's ice cold.

1069
00:40:24,996 --> 00:40:27,565
I felt a sense of accomplishment.

1070
00:40:27,566 --> 00:40:30,106
As MINHO said, running until the end...

1071
00:40:30,336 --> 00:40:32,206
made me feel good.

1072
00:40:33,776 --> 00:40:37,245
Gosh, I'm so happy.

1073
00:40:37,246 --> 00:40:39,946
