1104
00:41:45,246 --> 00:41:46,346
Exactly.

1105
00:41:46,846 --> 00:41:50,155
Our average pace is 7 minutes and 43 seconds per km.

1106
00:41:50,156 --> 00:41:51,485
We ran so fast.

1107
00:41:51,486 --> 00:41:52,486
Seven minutes and forty-three seconds?

1108
