You know, I had this thought.

1116
00:42:11,476 --> 00:42:14,905
If we stop...

1117
00:42:14,906 --> 00:42:16,575
right here,

1118
00:42:16,576 --> 00:42:19,186
I'm 100 percent sure that Hyun Moo will go,

1119
