1140
00:43:04,896 --> 00:43:07,326
- It's nice to run slowly. - That's right.

1141
00:43:07,696 --> 00:43:09,635
Running needs a new trend.

1142
00:43:09,636 --> 00:43:11,565
That's right. Ji Hyeon is good.

1143
00:43:11,566 --> 00:43:12,566
For goodness' sake.

1144
00:43:12,567 --> 00:43:13,705
I think it's really nice.

1145
