1149
00:43:21,606 --> 00:43:22,746
It's really hard to do that.

1150
00:43:23,116 --> 00:43:25,815
- It annoys me too. - Why did he make that lousy crew?

1151
00:43:25,816 --> 00:43:27,016
It annoys me so much.

1152
