1175
00:44:14,566 --> 00:44:15,596
That's a good idea.

1176
00:44:17,236 --> 00:44:18,336
Will it be okay?

1177
00:44:19,006 --> 00:44:20,066
Just once.

1178
00:44:21,536 --> 00:44:23,475
