1179
00:44:23,476 --> 00:44:24,536
Just once.

1180
00:44:25,376 --> 00:44:27,005
- Sounds good. - Let's have one more set.

1181
00:44:27,006 --> 00:44:28,776
- Sounds good. - He is a fighter.

1182
00:44:28,916 --> 00:44:30,376
