1211
00:45:35,376 --> 00:45:36,845
The pace of 4 minutes and 30 seconds in the mountains?

1212
00:45:36,846 --> 00:45:38,846
- He is insane. - MINHO didn't run properly before.

1213
00:45:40,646 --> 00:45:42,886
(Kian84 is right behind him.)

1214
00:45:43,756 --> 00:45:45,526
