1216
00:45:47,026 --> 00:45:48,356
He is an experienced runner.

1217
00:45:50,226 --> 00:45:51,595
(Retching)

1218
00:45:51,596 --> 00:45:53,365
(Retching)

1219
00:45:53,366 --> 00:45:55,326
That's a sign for you to go home.

1220
00:45:56,536 --> 00:45:57,636
I want to walk.

1221
00:45:57,766 --> 00:45:58,935
Walking makes it harder.

1222
00:45:58,936 --> 00:46:00,066
No, I want to walk.

1223
00:46:00,306 --> 00:46:01,466
Walking makes it harder.

1224
00:46:01,736 --> 00:46:02,835
No, I want to walk.

1225
00:46:02,836 --> 00:46:04,206
- It was a solo fight. - Walking makes it harder.

1226
00:46:04,806 --> 00:46:06,376
- It was a solo fight. - No, I want to walk.

1227
00:46:08,676 --> 00:46:09,815
Let's run together for the last bit.

1228
00:46:09,816 --> 00:46:11,746
