1233
00:46:23,196 --> 00:46:24,926
Let's speed up until the end.

1234
00:46:27,666 --> 00:46:28,835
- We're nearly there. - Let's go.

1235
00:46:28,836 --> 00:46:29,966
- Let's do this. - Let's go.

1236
00:46:30,336 --> 00:46:31,495
- We're nearly there. A bit more. - Na Ra.

1237
00:46:31,496 --> 00:46:33,266
- Speed up a bit more. - Na Ra.

1238
00:46:33,636 --> 00:46:35,136
Na Ra, come on.

1239
00:46:35,206 --> 00:46:36,605
- I gritted my teeth and ran. - A bit more.

1240
00:46:36,606 --> 00:46:37,906
A bit more. You can do it.

1241
00:46:38,806 --> 00:46:40,276
- We're nearly there. - Okay.

1242
00:46:40,606 --> 00:46:42,176
- Okay. - A bit more.

1243
00:46:42,346 --> 00:46:43,476
- Hey. - Come on.

1244
00:46:44,746 --> 00:46:46,345
