1248
00:46:52,226 --> 00:46:53,285
Well done.

1249
00:46:53,286 --> 00:46:55,796
- Let's go. - We ran about 13km to 14km...

1250
00:46:55,956 --> 00:46:57,695
- for trail running. - We ran 13km.

1251
00:46:57,696 --> 00:46:59,496
(Total distance: About 13km)

1252
00:46:59,726 --> 00:47:03,195
