1267
00:47:30,656 --> 00:47:32,366
(The uphill was so dangerous.)

1268
00:47:33,596 --> 00:47:34,896
My heart rate was 190bpm.

1269
00:47:35,266 --> 00:47:36,636
My heart rate was 190bpm.

1270
00:47:36,836 --> 00:47:38,135
(His heart ran at full speed as well.)

1271
00:47:38,136 --> 00:47:39,206
I'm dying.

1272
00:47:40,566 --> 00:47:42,676
- You have remaining stamina, right? - A little bit.

1273
00:47:43,076 --> 00:47:44,105
He is a monster.

1274
00:47:44,106 --> 00:47:45,746
- You have remaining stamina, right? - Go and have another round.

1275
00:47:47,546 --> 00:47:49,616
