1845
01:10:30,402 --> 01:10:32,502
This spot is perfect. I put it up here, Grandma.

1846
01:10:32,842 --> 01:10:34,241
He must've been happy.

1847
01:10:34,242 --> 01:10:35,672
(He must've been happy that his grandson got him a meal.)

1848
01:10:37,172 --> 01:10:39,142
Ju Seung blended them...

1849
01:10:39,542 --> 01:10:40,942
so you can have tomatoes.

1850
