It was a survival show among directors.

1858
01:11:00,223 --> 01:11:01,883
It was a competition between directors.

1859
01:11:02,323 --> 01:11:04,623
I joined a competition.

1860
01:11:05,763 --> 01:11:08,663
- And I won. I won first place. - Oh, my.

1861
01:11:09,833 --> 01:11:12,663
(Ju Seung tried his hand at directing.)

1862
01:11:13,603 --> 01:11:16,803
(With an unrivaled directing of a thriller...)

1863
01:11:17,173 --> 01:11:23,273
(Director Lee Ju Seung)

1864
01:11:24,073 --> 01:11:25,682
(He won first place after a fierce competition.)

1865
01:11:25,683 --> 01:11:27,113
Director Lee.

1866
