Let him go for the audition.

1872
01:11:40,893 --> 01:11:42,762
Let's see Ju Seung making it to the Cannes Film Festival.

1873
01:11:42,763 --> 01:11:44,893
- He definitely should make it. - He'll make it for sure.

1874
01:11:46,563 --> 01:11:48,562
(The future Cannes Film Festival awarded director...)

1875
