Gosh, Ju Seung, you did it. My goodness.

1881
01:12:04,713 --> 01:12:06,423
- Don't cry. - Grandpa...

1882
01:12:06,683 --> 01:12:08,122
always called me Director Lee.

1883
01:12:08,123 --> 01:12:09,952
I'm sad he didn't get to see me make it.

1884
01:12:09,953 --> 01:12:11,092
(Grandpa didn't get to see me become a director.)

1885
01:12:11,093 --> 01:12:12,193
I won first place.

1886
