Let's take a look at the trophy.

1887
01:12:18,663 --> 01:12:19,833
Thank you.

1888
01:12:22,503 --> 01:12:24,973
Stay healthy. Health comes first.

1889
01:12:26,273 --> 01:12:27,403
Just stay healthy.

1890
01:12:29,013 --> 01:12:32,382
- Grandpa would've loved it. - I know. He'd have loved it.

1891
01:12:32,383 --> 01:12:34,543
(Grandpa would've loved it.)

1892
01:12:36,613 --> 01:12:37,853
Thank you.

1893
