1895
01:12:52,533 --> 01:12:54,762
Grandpa always told me to always give back.

1896
01:12:54,763 --> 01:12:56,972
- I know. - So I donated everything.

1897
01:12:56,973 --> 01:12:58,202
- That's so cool. - I donated the entire thing.

1898
01:12:58,203 --> 01:13:00,443
There are so many things to learn from him.

1899
01:13:00,773 --> 01:13:02,913
I'm really...

1900
01:13:13,653 --> 01:13:14,823
Well done.

1901
01:13:15,123 --> 01:13:17,522
You donated after winning. Well done.

1902
01:13:17,523 --> 01:13:20,363
Grandpa always told you to donate a lot.

1903
01:13:23,793 --> 01:13:27,563
(You should share, give, and serve others.)

1904
01:13:28,463 --> 01:13:31,503
(You need to be humble. You need to be kind.)

1905
01:13:32,003 --> 01:13:35,442
(You'll do well.)

1906
01:13:35,443 --> 01:13:36,573
Grandpa...

1907
01:13:37,973 --> 01:13:40,813
Ever since I first directed a short movie,

1908
01:13:41,583 --> 01:13:43,113
he told me I'd make it as a director.

1909
01:13:43,283 --> 01:13:45,053
Whenever I called him,

1910
01:13:45,313 --> 01:13:46,453
he called me Director Lee.

1911
01:13:47,653 --> 01:13:49,752
(Even on his phone, Ju Seung is saved as Director Lee.)

1912
01:13:49,753 --> 01:13:51,193
He called me Director Lee.

1913
01:13:51,653 --> 01:13:55,563
While writing the final script for the survival show,

1914
01:13:56,093 --> 01:13:58,593
he passed away.

1915
01:13:59,733 --> 01:14:02,773
After the funeral, I took some time to pull myself together.

1916
01:14:03,103 --> 01:14:04,503
Then I continued writing.

1917
01:14:05,003 --> 01:14:07,873
To forget the sadness of his passing,

1918
01:14:08,343 --> 01:14:09,713
I immersed myself more into writing.

1919
01:14:10,113 --> 01:14:12,482
I feel like Grandpa helped me too.

1920
01:14:12,483 --> 01:14:13,743
(Perhaps Grandpa helped him from the skies.)

1921
01:14:14,883 --> 01:14:16,583
At the Han River...

1922
01:14:17,453 --> 01:14:18,712
He answered.

1923
01:14:18,713 --> 01:14:22,593
(The newbie director wrote a script in his room.)

1924
01:14:24,253 --> 01:14:29,063
(He used to use a phone to film. After that stage,)

1925
01:14:30,163 --> 01:14:33,563
(he completed his dream...)

1926
01:14:34,263 --> 01:14:37,933
(of becoming a director page by page.)

1927
01:14:39,403 --> 01:14:41,342
(Just as his grandpa predicted, he became Director Lee...)

1928
01:14:41,343 --> 01:14:43,273
(who's acknowledged by everyone.)

1929
