It felt...

1930
01:14:48,883 --> 01:14:49,983
a bit...

1931
01:14:53,053 --> 01:14:54,753
Thanks to Grandpa,

1932
01:14:57,593 --> 01:15:00,793
I won a great award, so I'm grateful.

1933
01:15:01,493 --> 01:15:03,933
Grandpa served others so much...

1934
