that he earned respect from that.

1935
01:15:08,403 --> 01:15:09,633
He was kind to others.

1936
01:15:10,203 --> 01:15:13,143
Because of that mindset,

1937
01:15:14,103 --> 01:15:15,543
I donated the whole amount.

1938
01:15:15,973 --> 01:15:19,543
I think I did it following his values.

1939
01:15:21,043 --> 01:15:23,352
I think it's an award that Grandpa won.

1940
01:15:23,353 --> 01:15:28,023
(In the end, it's like an award that Grandpa won.)

1941
01:15:32,693 --> 01:15:34,093
That's what I said.

1942
01:15:36,433 --> 01:15:37,533
I'm here, Grandpa.

1943
01:15:38,993 --> 01:15:42,162
(He always welcomed Ju Seung with a bright smile.)

1944
