You're only 73.

1945
01:15:44,273 --> 01:15:49,243
(They'd chat for a long time like they're friends.)

1946
01:15:50,143 --> 01:15:51,873
Then add the juice here.

1947
01:15:53,043 --> 01:15:57,253
(Grandpa he shared anything he found delicious)

1948
01:15:57,753 --> 01:15:59,053
- Good. - Is that right?

1949
01:16:12,503 --> 01:16:13,562
Grandpa.

1950
01:16:13,563 --> 01:16:15,432
(He shows the award to his grandpa as well.)

1951
01:16:15,433 --> 01:16:17,933
I won an award thanks to you, Grandpa.

1952
01:16:21,043 --> 01:16:23,042
- Let's turn the lights on. - I miss him.

1953
01:16:23,043 --> 01:16:24,043
He must've been really happy.

1954
01:16:24,044 --> 01:16:25,983
(He turned the donation certificate so he could read it better.)

1955
01:16:26,183 --> 01:16:27,183
Goodness.

1956
