Does your arm hurt?

1979
01:17:58,103 --> 01:18:01,502
No, I just keep massaging it out of habit.

1980
01:18:01,503 --> 01:18:03,073
Which part hurts the most these days?

1981
01:18:03,543 --> 01:18:05,743
- It hurts everywhere. - It hurts everywhere?

1982
01:18:06,083 --> 01:18:07,983
Elders ache everywhere.

1983
