1988
01:18:19,323 --> 01:18:21,062
You're good at changing topics.

1989
01:18:21,063 --> 01:18:22,492
- That's right. - Nice timing.

1990
01:18:22,493 --> 01:18:24,633
- You need to keep changing. - That was sensible of you.

1991
